     probed _b_h_n_d___e_r_o_m___c_l_a_s_s___t instance on success, a null pointer otherwise.

     The bbhhnndd__eerroomm__aalllloocc() function returns a pointer to _b_h_n_d___e_r_o_m___t on suc‐
